# The build context of the API and website images (apps/api/Dockerfile, apps/web/Dockerfile, built
# from the repository root) is an allowlist: the workspace manifests, the two apps and the packages
# they are built from. Environment files, private notes (.context/), worktrees, scratch files, test
# results and build output never enter an image.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/api/
!apps/web/
!packages/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.turbo/
**/.next/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/.env
**/.env.*
